            <p class="text-muted small text-center mb-2">The straight dashed lines represent asymptotic approximations; solid colored curves represent actual filter responses. Notice the characteristic <InlineEquation equation="-3\text{ dB}"/> drop and <InlineEquation equation="-45^\circ"/> / <InlineEquation equation="-90^\circ"/> phase shift at the cutoff frequency <InlineEquation equation="f_c"/>.</p>
